    ["<Assistant_Title1>【记忆的传承】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法类型：</><Assistant_Property1>5~6人家族副本</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法介绍：</>开启“记忆的传承”仪式后，玩家将进入记忆世界，与过去经历过的强敌再次交锋。与家族成员共同进入时，可获得【誓火共燃】与【血脉盟约】增益。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>点击<Assistant_System>菜单-世界冒险-副本-记忆的传承</>参与。\n<Assistant_Title2>首领与参与条件：</>\n    <Assistant_Property1>强尼：</>普通难度39级，推荐非凡评分9359；困难难度61级，推荐非凡评分47716。\n    <Assistant_Property1>钻头：</>普通难度46级，推荐非凡评分18236；困难难度63级，推荐非凡评分56222。\n    <Assistant_Property1>邦尼：</>普通难度56级，推荐非凡评分28651；困难难度66级，推荐非凡评分73673。\n    <Assistant_Property1>战争巨龙：</>普通难度60级，推荐非凡评分45868；困难难度68级，推荐非凡评分77962；噩梦难度70级，推荐非凡评分91225。\n<Assistant_Title2>开放顺序：</>普通钻头于赛季第2天开放，普通邦尼第4天开放，普通战争巨龙第5天开放；困难强尼第6天开放，困难钻头第8天开放，困难邦尼第12天开放，困难战争巨龙第14天开放；噩梦战争巨龙第22天开放。\n<Assistant_Title2>挑战说明：</>各首领均支持5~6人组队，并可选择人机模式。不同首领和难度独立开放，请根据角色等级与推荐非凡评分选择挑战目标。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Inheritance of Memory] </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Type: </> <Assistant_Property1> 5~6 Player Family Dungeon </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Introduction: </> After starting the \"Inheritance of Memory\" ritual, players will enter the world of memory to clash again with powerful enemies from the past. When entering with family members, you can obtain [Oathfire Combustion] and [Bloodline Covenant] buffs. \n <Assistant_Title2> How to Participate: </> Click <Assistant_System> Menu - World Adventure - Dungeon - Inheritance of Memory </> to participate. \n <Assistant_Title2> Bosses and Participation Requirements: </> \n <Assistant_Property1> Johnny: </> Normal Difficulty Level 39, recommended Beyonder Rating 9359; Hard Difficulty Level 61, recommended Beyonder Rating 47716. \n <Assistant_Property1> Drill: </> Normal Difficulty Level 46, recommended Beyonder Rating 18236; Hard Difficulty Level 63, recommended Beyonder Rating 56222. \n <Assistant_Property1> Bonnie: </> Normal Difficulty Level 56, recommended Beyonder Rating 28651; Hard Difficulty Level 66, recommended Beyonder Rating 73673. \n <Assistant_Property1> War Dragon: </> Normal Difficulty Level 60, recommended Beyonder Rating 45868; Hard Difficulty Level 68, recommended Beyonder Rating 77962; Nightmare Difficulty Level 70, recommended Beyonder Rating 91225. \n <Assistant_Title2> Opening Order: </> Normal Drill opens on Day 2 of the season, Normal Bonnie on Day 4, Normal War Dragon on Day 5; Hard Johnny opens on Day 6, Hard Drill on Day 8, Hard Bonnie on Day 12, Hard War Dragon on Day 14; Nightmare War Dragon opens on Day 22. \n <Assistant_Title2> Challenge Instructions: </> All bosses support 5~6 player teams and AI mode. Different bosses and difficulties open independently; please choose your challenge target based on character level and recommended Beyonder Rating.",
